1
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:51,599
Alpha and Omega: The Big Fureeze is a family,
animation film directed by Tim Maltby.

2
00:03:31,199 --> 00:03:37,199
Kate and Humphrey head out into the woods to look for food to stock up on for
winter, and they leave their three pups with their parents.

3
00:05:16,799 --> 00:05:22,799
But the pups and the rest of the pack must venture out in search
of them after the duo get caught in a blizzard.

4
00:07:02,399 --> 00:07:08,399
Kate / Stinky (voice), played by Kate Higgins.

5
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:54,000
Humphrey / Bear 1 (voice), played by Ben Diskin.

6
00:10:33,599 --> 00:10:39,599
Claudette (voice), played by Marieve Herington.

7
00:12:19,199 --> 00:12:25,199
Runt (voice), played by Debi Derryberry.

8
00:14:04,799 --> 00:14:10,799
Paddy / Marcel (voice), played by Christopher Corey Smith.

9
00:15:50,399 --> 00:15:56,399
Alpha and Omega is a 2010 American animated romantic comedy
adventure film directed by Anthony Bell and Ben Gluck.

10
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:42,000
Starring the voices of Justin Long, Hayden Panettiere, Dennis Hopper, Danny Glover and Christina Ricci, the
film was written by Christopher Denk and Steve Moore, based on a story by Moore and Gluck.

11
00:19:21,599 --> 00:19:27,599
The film sets around two young Rocky Mountain wolves named Kate (Panettiere) and Humphrey (Long)
who fall in love with each other, but are on the opposite ends of their pack.

12
00:21:07,199 --> 00:21:13,199
However, when Kate and Humphrey learn that they got relocated to Idaho for repopulation, they must work
together to get back to Jasper National Park before a war slowly begins to emerge between both packs.

13
00:22:52,799 --> 00:22:58,799
The film premiered at the Toronto International Film Festival on September 8, 2010, and
was released nationwide in 2-D and 3-D on September 17, 2010, by Lionsgate.

14
00:24:38,399 --> 00:24:44,399
Alpha and Omega was a box-office success, grossing $50.5 million against a budget of
$20 million, but received generally negative reviews from critics.

15
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:30,000
Despite its negative reception, however, it has received a cult following.

16
00:28:09,599 --> 00:28:15,599
The film was dedicated to Hopper, as he died from prostate
cancer four months before it was released.

17
00:29:55,199 --> 00:30:01,199
The film eventually turned into a franchise of 7 direct-to-video sequels including Alpha
and Omega 2: A Howl-iday Adventure, which was released on October 8, 2013.

18
00:31:40,799 --> 00:31:46,799
Another sequel, The Great Wolf Games, was released on March 25, 2014.

19
00:33:26,399 --> 00:33:32,399
The Legend of the Saw Tooth Cave was released on September 23, 2014.

20
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:18,000
Family Vacation was released to DVD on August 4, 2015.

21
00:36:57,599 --> 00:37:03,599
Dino Digs was released on DVD and Digital HD on May 10, 2016.

22
00:38:43,199 --> 00:38:49,199
It was followed by The Big Fur-eeze, which was released on November 8, 2016.

23
00:40:28,799 --> 00:40:34,799
The final installment, Journey to Bear Kingdom was
released on DVD and Digital HD on May 9, 2017.

24
00:42:14,399 --> 00:42:20,399
The film explores themes of wolf, cartoon, christmas.
